    {
      "review_id": "72683",
      "reviewer_name": "David",
      "reviewer_location": "VIC - 3054",
      "reviewer_state": "VIC",
      "reviewer_postcode": "3054",
      "reviewer_postcode_valid": true,
      "review_date": "2020-01-23",
      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The Solar Flow quote was the most expensive, but no corners were cut.  The 14 Sunpower panels were upgraded to 325W models and the Enphase Envoy IQ7 control unit was installed out of sight in the attic. Alex Smith is knowledgeable and professional and was there at time of quotation and installation.  Angus Young was efficient, polite and professional during the installation process, as was his apprentice Mark.  They did the installation over two days and left the site neat and tidy.  \"Paperwork\" was quickly dealt with by text and email.  The independent electrical inspector came within 7 days of installation, despite advice that there was a backlog of two to three weeks.  Panels were installed on a roof in a very efficient manner, given major winter overshadowing.  In summary, Solar Flow accommodated all of our requirements.   We received notification this morning that \"paperwork\" has been sent to CitiPower for grid-connection and to Powershop for billing.",
